  "contentHtml": "<P style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=0><SPAN style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">안녕하세요.</SPAN></P>\r\n<P style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=0><SPAN style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">재미있는 과학수업 만들기입니다.</SPAN></P>\r\n<P style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=0>&nbsp;</P>\r\n<P style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=0><SPAN style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\"><SPAN style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif\">최근 </SPAN><SPAN style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif\">카페에서 </SPAN></SPAN></P>\r\n<P style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=0><SPAN style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">저작권 보호와 실명제로의 전환에 대한 논의가 진행되었습니다</SPAN><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">.</SPAN></P>\r\n<P style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=0><SPAN style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif\">&nbsp; </SPAN></P>\r\n<P style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=0>&nbsp;</P>\r\n<P style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=0><SPAN style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\"><SPAN style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif\">이 공간</SPAN><SPAN style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif\">의 성격이 과학교사간의 정보교류</SPAN><SPAN style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif\">&nbsp;카페이고</SPAN></SPAN><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">,</SPAN></P>\r\n<P style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=0><SPAN style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">회원들이 올린 귀중한 자료가 무단배포되는 것을 막고</SPAN><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">, </SPAN></P>\r\n<P style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=0><SPAN style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">회원들 간의 교류를 더욱 활발하게 하기 위한 장치가 있으면 좋겠다는 논의였습니다</SPAN><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">.</SPAN><SPAN style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif\">&nbsp; </SPAN></P>\r\n<P style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=0><SPAN style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif\">&nbsp; </SPAN></P>\r\n<P style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=0><SPAN style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">운영진 및 정회원님들과 협의한</SPAN></P>\r\n<P style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=0><SPAN style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">두가지 사항을 알려드립니다</SPAN><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">.</SPAN></P>\r\n<P style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=0><SPAN style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif\">&nbsp; </SPAN></P>\r\n<P style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=0><STRONG><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">1. </SPAN><SPAN style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">닉네임을 수정해주십시오</SPAN><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">.</SPAN></STRONG></P>\r\n<P style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=0><SPAN style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">&nbsp; 실명</SPAN><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">(</SPAN><SPAN style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">학교명</SPAN><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">) </SPAN><SPAN style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">사용을 권장합니다</SPAN><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">.</SPAN></P>\r\n<P style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=0><SPAN style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">&nbsp; 어려우시면 실명</SPAN><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">(</SPAN><SPAN style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">지역</SPAN><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">) </SPAN><SPAN style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">혹은 닉네임</SPAN><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">(</SPAN><SPAN style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">지역</SPAN><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">) </SPAN><SPAN style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">중에서 한 가지로 수정해주십시오</SPAN><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">.</SPAN></P>\r\n<P style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=0><SPAN style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif\">&nbsp; </SPAN></P>\r\n<P style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=0><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">&nbsp; (</SPAN><SPAN style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">수정 방법</SPAN><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">)</SPAN></P>\r\n<P style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=0><SPAN style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">&nbsp; 내정보 클릭 </SPAN><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">(</SPAN><SPAN style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">왼쪽 하단의 </SPAN><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">'</SPAN><SPAN style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">카페 글쓰기</SPAN><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">' </SPAN><SPAN style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">바로 위에</SPAN><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">) </SPAN><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">→ </SPAN><SPAN style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">수정 클릭 </SPAN></P>\r\n<P style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=0><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; BACKGROUND: #ffffff;